    If float, units are inches. If string, interpreted by `~ultraplot.utils.units`.
loc : str, optional
    The colorbar location. Valid location keys are as follows.

    ==========  =====================
    Location    Valid keys
    ==========  =====================
    left        ``'left'``, ``'l'``
    right       ``'right'``, ``'r'``
    bottom      ``'bottom'``, ``'b'``
    top         ``'top'``, ``'t'``
    ==========  =====================

space : float or str, default: None
